{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Three Qualities: a past life story","html":"<article id='ja58'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Jātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Stories of Past Lives 58 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Āsīsavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Hope </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>8. Tayodhammajātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Three Qualities: a past life story </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Yassa ete tayo dhammā, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Whoever possesses these three qualities </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>vānarinda yathā tava; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>like you, lord of langurs—</span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Dakkhiyaṁ sūriyaṁ paññā, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>adroitness, heroism, wisdom—</span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>diṭṭhaṁ so ativattatī”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>escapes the visible foe. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>Tayodhammajātakaṁ aṭṭhamaṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
